#: 01-evernight.qml:18
msgctxt "@info:window"
msgid "Evernight Vista New User Guide"
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:19
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"The following tools can help you get started quickly and enhance your system "
"experience."
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:46
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Nvidia Driver Manager"
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:52
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you have an NVIDIA graphics card, use the NVIDIA Driver Manager to "
"install drivers. The Evernight Vista kernel can recognize most hardware "
"drivers, and these drivers can work automatically without installing extra "
"drivers, but NVIDIA drivers need proprietary ones to work properly or to get "
"better performance."
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:59 01-evernight.qml:102 01-evernight.qml:145
#: 01-evernight.qml:188
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Start"
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:89
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Install Software & Update System"
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:95
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Miryu Software Center can provide security updates, feature updates, and "
"kernel updates for the Evernight Vista operating system, helping to maintain "
"its security, boost performance, and add support for new hardware. In "
"addition, you can also install software from flatpak and linyaps in the "
"Miryu Software Center."
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:132
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "System Settings"
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:138
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Open the KDE system settings, and you can set up your Evernight Vista "
"operating system your way, like configuring peripherals and appearance."
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:175
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Btrfs Assistant"
msgstr ""

#: 01-evernight.qml:181
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Using the Btrfs assistant to set up Snapper and create Btrfs snapshots can "
"help you easily roll back the system in case of problems after updating or "
"other issues."
msgstr ""
